# Vendor Log

Out-of-codebase actions required. Things that can't be fixed by editing files — vendor dashboard configuration, key rotation, DNS changes, third-party service setup.

> Tracked separately from `ERROR-LOG.md` because these need to happen but aren't code changes. They affect the project's security posture and operational state even though they don't show in `git log`.

