## Entry Template

```
### VND-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN

**Severity:** Critical | High | Medium | Low
**Vendor / Platform:** [e.g., Supabase Dashboard, Stripe Dashboard, AWS Console, Cloudflare]
**Discovered:** YYYY-MM-DD
**Action required:** [Specific configuration change needed.]
**Why:** [What this addresses — what risk it mitigates or feature it enables.]
**Verification:** [How to confirm the action was taken correctly.]
**Status:** Open | Completed
**Completed (when done):** YYYY-MM-DD by [who]
```

